e right when in fact most of the time  things are done right  but  in  practicalities this is just slowing it  down  in his fight with local planning  agencies over the transformers howard  has prevailed for now he hired a  consulting firm which argued that the  statues constitute works of fine art  conveying the concept of transformation  from some more earthly object into their  hero mode i.e from car truck plane into  action  the old georgetown board agreed to let  him keep the statues on the condition  that he renew his permit every six  months  we're all transformers  we're all about transforming things  transforming is in essence of human  nature how we become in harmony with our  environment  [Music]  you

